# Reference grammar: tutorials/regression/lib.sh.
# error <field> <norm> <expected> <tolerance>
# Case defaults: N 10, Pe_L 46, gmsh 4.15.2, seed 1. Tolerances
# cover the spread over gmsh mesh seeds 1 to 4.
